        "sender_full_name": "Thomas Waring",
        "timestamp": 1786633235
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>We don't have that much API about topological bases so it's not that surprising. My gut suggestion would be to use <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=TopologicalSpace.IsTopologicalBasis.nhds_hasBasis#doc\">docs#TopologicalSpace.IsTopologicalBasis.nhds_hasBasis</a>, <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=TopologicalSpace.IsTopologicalBasis.of_hasBasis_nhds#doc\">docs#TopologicalSpace.IsTopologicalBasis.of_hasBasis_nhds</a>, and our extensive API about filter bases.</p>",
        "id": 616338139,
        "sender_full_name": "Anatole Dedecker",
        "timestamp": 1786633511
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Oh, actually we have them: <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=TopologicalSpace.IsTopologicalBasis.isInducing#doc\">docs#TopologicalSpace.IsTopologicalBasis.isInducing</a> and <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=TopologicalSpace.IsTopologicalBasis.isQuotientMap#doc\">docs#TopologicalSpace.IsTopologicalBasis.isQuotientMap</a></p>",
        "id": 616338729,
        "sender_full_name": "Anatole Dedecker",
        "timestamp": 1786633649
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>The latter of which should be restated in terms of <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=IsOpenQuotientMap#doc\">docs#IsOpenQuotientMap</a></p>",
        "id": 616338882,
        "sender_full_name": "Anatole Dedecker",
        "timestamp": 1786633682
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>(Note: to get that an injective open continuous map is inducing, use <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=Topology.IsOpenEmbedding.of_continuous_injective_isOpenMap#doc\">docs#Topology.IsOpenEmbedding.of_continuous_injective_isOpenMap</a>)</p>",
        "id": 616342616,
        "sender_full_name": "Anatole Dedecker",
        "timestamp": 1786634642
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>ahh great, thanks! i think i saw one or both of those but hadn't internalised what\"<code>IsQuotientMap</code> etc meant</p>\n<p>cc: <span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"110637\">@Ching-Tsun Chou</span>, the first of the quoted results might simplify your proof of <code>isTopologicalBasis_cylinders</code> using <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=PiNat.isTopologicalBasis_cylinders#doc\">docs#PiNat.isTopologicalBasis_cylinders</a>, if you're interested</p>",
        "id": 616364252,
        "sender_full_name": "Thomas Waring",
        "timestamp": 1786640615
    }
]